# Admin APIs (System-wide authority)

## Users (Admin can CRUD any user)

### GET /users

Query: role, status, team_id, q, pagination
Response

json
{ "items": [ { / User object (same as auth.login.user) / } ], "next_cursor": null, "count": 1 }


### POST /users

Request

json
{
  "email": "string",
  "username": "string",
  "password": "string",
  "first_name": "string",
  "last_name": "string",
  "phone": "string|null",
  "bio": "string|null",
  "linkedin_profile_url": "string|null",
  "timezone": "string",
  "role": "admin|sub_admin|member",
  "status": "active|inactive|suspended",
  "team_id": "uuid|null"
}


Response

json
{ / User object / }


### GET /users/{id}

Response

json
{ / User object / }


### PUT /users/{id}

Request

json
{
  "username": "string",
  "first_name": "string",
  "last_name": "string",
  "phone": "string|null",
  "bio": "string|null",
  "linkedin_profile_url": "string|null",
  "timezone": "string",
  "role": "admin|sub_admin|member",
  "status": "active|inactive|suspended",
  "team_id": "uuid|null",
  "is_active": true,
  "is_verified": true,
  "is_locked": false
}


Response

json
{ / User object / }


### DELETE /users/{id}

Response

json
{ "success": true }


