## Analytics & Reports (Admin scope)

### GET /analytics/dashboard

Query: scope=admin, range=day|week|month|custom, from, to
Response

json
{
  "kpis": {
    "total_bids": 0,
    "wins": 0,
    "win_rate": "number|string",
    "connect_spend": "number|string",
    "revenue": "number|string",
    "profit_margin": "number|string"
  },
  "charts": {
    "bids_over_time": [{ "date": "date", "bids": 0, "wins": 0 }],
    "revenue_over_time": [{ "date": "date", "revenue": "number|string" }],
    "vertical_breakdown": [{ "vertical_id": "uuid", "name": "string", "wins": 0, "revenue": "number|string" }]
  }
}


### GET /analytics/reports

Query: type=bid_performance|financial|operational, format=json, filters
Response

json
{ "type": "string", "generated_at": "datetime", "data": {} }


### POST /analytics/export

Request

json
{
  "type": "bid_performance|financial|operational",
  "format": "csv|xlsx|pdf|json",
  "filters": { "team_id": "uuid|null", "range": { "from": "date", "to": "date" } }
}


Response

json
{
  "export_id": "uuid",
  "status": "queued|processing|ready",
  "download_url": "string|null"
}


