# Sub-Admin APIs (Scoped to own team)

> Sub-Admin can view/manage within their team_id. Filters must include/resolve to their team.

## Team (read-only for structure, includes members)

### GET /teams/{id}

Response

json
{ / Team object / }


### GET /teams/{id}/members

Response

json
{ "items": [ { / User object (member) / } ], "next_cursor": null, "count": 1 }


### GET /teams/{id}/goals

Response

json
{ "items": [ { / TeamGoal object / } ], "next_cursor": null, "count": 1 }


## Verticals (browse only)

