# Member APIs (Personal scope)

## Verticals (assigned to the member)

### GET /users/{user_id}/verticals

Response

json
{ "items": [ { / UserVertical object / } ], "next_cursor": null, "count": 1 }


## Bids (member can CRUD own bids within 5-day edit window)

### GET /bids

Query: member_id (self), status, vertical_id, budget_type, date_from, date_to, q, pagination
Response

json
{ "items": [ { / Bid object / } ], "next_cursor": null, "count": 1 }


### POST /bids

Request

json
{
  "job_title": "string",
  "job_url": "string|null",
  "job_description": "string|null",
  "client_name": "string|null",
  "vertical_id": "uuid",
  "member_id": "uuid",
  "team_id": "uuid",
  "budget_type": "fixed|hourly",
  "budget_min": "number|string|null",
  "budget_max": "number|string|null",
  "hourly_rate": "number|string|null",
  "estimated_hours": 0,
  "connects_used": 1,
  "boost_connects_used": 0,
  "proposal_text": "string|null",
  "cover_letter": "string|null",
  "is_featured": false,
  "competition_level": 1,
  "notes": "string|null"
}


Response

json
{ / Bid object / }


