## Analytics (personal)

### GET /analytics/dashboard

Query: scope=member, user_id (self), range=day|week|month|custom, from, to
Response

json
{
  "kpis": {
    "total_bids": 0,
    "wins": 0,
    "win_rate": "number|string",
    "connect_spend": "number|string",
    "revenue": "number|string",
    "profit_margin": "number|string"
  },
  "charts": {
    "bids_over_time": [{ "date": "date", "bids": 0, "wins": 0 }],
    "vertical_breakdown": [{ "vertical_id": "uuid", "name": "string", "wins": 0 }]
  }
}


---

## Notes on Pagination & Envelopes (applies to all list endpoints)

Query params: limit (int, default 20), cursor (string), sort (e.g., -created_at), plus endpoint-specific filters.
List response:

json
{ "items": [ / ... / ], "next_cursor": "string|null", "count": 20 }

